    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For the second consecutive year, the Aga Khan University (AKU) has been recognised by the Society of Research Administrators International (SRAI), underscoring the University's growing influence and excellence in research support and leadership. Adnan Altaf, Senior Manager at AKU's Research Office in Pakistan, has been named a 2025 honouree in SRAI's prestigious Future of the Field programme.",
